SUMMARY:Streaming Passes for the Brooklyn SciFi Film Festival
DESCRIPTION:The Sci Fi Book Club\nHi everybody!\n\n[The Brooklyn SciFi Fil
 m Festival](https://brooklynscififilmfest.com/) kicks off its seventh seas
 on with over 200 independent Sci-Fi films from 34 countries streaming onli
 ne for two weeks. The festival is an annual celebration of independent sci
 ence fiction filmmaking\, and over the years\, BSFFF has highlighted hundr
 eds of bold voices in the genre.\n\nGrab your digital pass on Eventbrite t
 o unlock a Netflix-style platform that you can search by category and even
  host virtual watch parties with friends. This year\, we celebrate 60 Year
 s of Star Trek with a series of Trek fan films\, panels\, and interactive 
 events. The Sixth Borough anthology series also returns each night of the 
 festival\, dropping a new episode of hand-picked\, standout science fictio
 n films.\n\n**[Purchase your online festival pass via Eventbrite here](htt
 ps://www.eventbrite.com/e/brooklyn-scifi-film-festival-digital-pass-ticket
 s-2000526111452?aff=ebdsshcopyurl&utm-campaign=social&utm-content=attendee
 share&utm-medium=discovery&utm-term=creator-collections&utm-share-source=c
 reator-collections)**\, your rsvp to this Meetup event is not enough. **If
  you're prompted for a discount code\, use SIFIBookClubBSF26 for 15% off.*
 *\n\nLet us know some of your favorites in the comments!\n\nIf you're in t
 he NYC area\, we hope you'll join us for an in-person event\, as well. Che
 ck out the lineup and join us if you can.\n\nCheers\,\nJon & Meghan
