SUMMARY:Best of Brooklyn Night @ Brooklyn SciFi Film Festival
DESCRIPTION:The Sci Fi Book Club\nHi everbody!\n\n[Brooklyn SciFi Film Fes
 tival](https://brooklynscififilmfest.com/) presents the Best of Brooklyn\,
  featuring an in-person screening of Brooklyn and NYC-based films\, on Wed
 nesday\, October 7th at Film Noir Cinema in Greenpoint\, Brooklyn. The pro
 gram will include nine sci-fi short films\, followed by a filmmaker Q&A an
 d networking.\n\n**[Purchase your tickets for this event via Eventbrite](h
 ttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/best-of-brooklyn-scifi-film-night-tickets-2000
 317414233?aff=ebdsshcopyurl&utm-campaign=social&utm-content=attendeeshare&
 utm-medium=discovery&utm-term=creator-collections&utm-share-source=creator
 -collections)\, your rsvp to this Meetup event is not enough.** Get your t
 ickets asap if you're interested\, this event will sell out!\n**Use the co
 de SIFIBookClubBSF26 for 15% off.**\n\nThe festival has highlighted hundre
 ds of bold voices in the genre\, and we're back for our seventh annual pro
 gram\, showcasing more than 200 films from around the world. BSFFF will ru
 n October 5–18\, 2026\, streaming online and at in-person events the 5th
 -11th across Brooklyn.\n\nHope to see you there!\nCheers\, Jon & Meghan
