SUMMARY:Nitehawk Night @ Brooklyn SciFi Festival
DESCRIPTION:The Sci Fi Book Club\nHi everybody!\n\n[Brooklyn SciFi Film Fe
 stival](https://brooklynscififilmfest.com/) presents a program of selected
  sci-fi short films from around the world\, followed by an after-party at 
 Nitehawk Cinema’s Prospect Park location. Join us for a night of indepen
 dent sci-fi films followed by drinks and mingling at Trees Lounge (second 
 floor of the venue). This is our premier event\, highlighting filmmakers f
 rom New York and around the world as we announce the winners of this year
 ’s festival.\n\n**[Purchase your tickets for this event via Eventbrite](
 https://www.eventbrite.com/e/nitehawk-cinema-brooklyn-scifi-film-festival-
 night-tickets-2000520657138?aff=ebdsshcopyurl&utm-campaign=social&utm-cont
 ent=attendeeshare&utm-medium=discovery&utm-term=creator-collections&utm-sh
 are-source=creator-collections)\, your rsvp to this Meetup event is not en
 ough.** Get your tickets asap if you're interested\, this event will sell 
 out!\n**Use the code SIFIBookClubBSF26 for 15% off.**\n\nThe festival has 
 highlighted hundreds of bold voices in the genre\, and we're back for our 
 seventh annual program\, showcasing more than 200 films from around the wo
 rld. BSFFF will run October 5–18\, 2026\, streaming online and at in-per
 son events the 5th-11th across Brooklyn.\n\nHope to see you there!\nCheers
 \,\nJon & Meghan
