SUMMARY:Cinoplex Feature Film Night @BSFFF
DESCRIPTION:The Sci Fi Book Club\nHi everybody!\n\n[Join the Brooklyn SciF
 i Film Festival](https://brooklynscififilmfest.com/) online for our Friday
  night Cineplex event where we'll stream six feature films. You choose the
  channel. You choose the film.\n\nThe BSFFF is celebrating our seventh sea
 son with over 200 independent Sci-Fi films from 34 countries streaming onl
 ine for two weeks. The festival is an annual celebration of independent sc
 ience fiction filmmaking\, and over the years\, BSFFF has highlighted hund
 reds of bold voices in the genre.\n\nGrab your digital pass on Eventbrite 
 to join this six-feature screening and unlock a Netflix-style platform tha
 t you can search by category and even host virtual watch parties with frie
 nds.\n\n**[Purchase your online festival pass via Eventbrite here](https:/
 /www.eventbrite.com/e/brooklyn-scifi-film-festival-digital-pass-tickets-20
 00526111452?aff=ebdsshcopyurl&utm-campaign=social&utm-content=attendeeshar
 e&utm-medium=discovery&utm-term=creator-collections&utm-share-source=creat
 or-collections)**\, your rsvp to this Meetup event is not enough.\n\n**Ent
 er the discount code SIFIBookClubBSF26 for 15% off.**\n\nLet us know some 
 of your favorites in the comments!\n\nIf you're in the NYC area\, we hope 
 you'll join us for an in-person event\, as well. Check out the lineup and 
 join us if you can.\n\nCheers\, Jon & Meghan
