SUMMARY:Friday Night Frights @ Brooklyn SciFi Festival
DESCRIPTION:The Sci Fi Book Club\nHi everybody!\n\n[Brooklyn SciFi Film Fe
 stival](https://brooklynscififilmfest.com/) presents an evening of SciFi/H
 orror films curated by the masters of macabre at Brooklyn Horror Film Fest
 ival to be hosted at Stuart Cinema\, Friday\, October 9th from 7:00 to 9:0
 0. Our first-time crossover event is sure to please fans of both science f
 iction and horror as we present a program of seven short films in Long Isl
 and City (Queens). Join us at 6:30 for a cocktail mixer before the event.\
 n\n**[Purchase your tickets for this event via Eventbrite](https://www.eve
 ntbrite.com/e/friday-night-frights-scifi-horror-night-tickets-200050622697
 7?aff=ebdsshcopyurl&utm-campaign=social&utm-content=attendeeshare&utm-medi
 um=discovery&utm-term=creator-collections&utm-share-source=creator-collect
 ions )\, your rsvp to this Meetup event is not enough.** Get your tickets 
 asap if you're interested\, this event will sell out!\n\n**Use the code SI
 FIBookClubBSF26 for 15% off.**\n\nThe festival has highlighted hundreds of
  bold voices in the genre\, and we're back for our seventh annual program\
 , showcasing more than 200 films from around the world. BSFFF will run Oct
 ober 5–18\, 2026\, streaming online and at in-person events the 5th-11th
  across Brooklyn.\n\nHope to see you there!\nCheers\, Jon & Meghan
